    \item \textbf{Feature Development:} Implemented key features including job posting management, candidate profile, company profile, and an \textbf{automated email notification service} using background queues. Built API layers enforcing \textbf{FluentValidation} and decoupled DTOs via \textbf{AutoMapper}.
    \item \textbf{Database Refactoring:} Restructured \textbf{MS SQL Server} schema across \textbf{60+ tables} -- standardized naming conventions, wrote migration scripts and backup protocols to guarantee \textbf{100\% data integrity} for \textbf{76,000+ candidates}, 3,000+ companies, and ~5,000 active job postings.
\end{itemize}
